        "title": "Ping maknga tatro abumang",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ping maknga tatro abumang,",
            "Khou tei Zion ching rukhou tei;",
            "He ching tei kao e nang tatro,",
            "Khou tei thing kross tei nang jaolo,",
            "Khou tei poubaumei ta suluai,",
            "Kapum nthanmei kajei luang.",
            "",
            "2. He kalvari ching kaomei khou,",
            "Charin tuang kanloumei hou e;",
            "Kandih kun padeimei guai le,",
            "Theimei guai jingmei khou bamme,",
            "Jing kandiu ching tei gan puni,",
            "Tingsangjang kata hou puni.",
            "",
            "3. Khangloumei jam tei jao khang #@8,",
            "Kata karana ganlou na;",
            "Kapi nkum keimei jao khang,",
            "Katana ntanga dam lou,",
            "Gun kumma khiu than khang ni nai,",
            "Lumlou makmei guai khang ramme."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
